Z||000006||DRH||01-02-2000||01:23 PM||||A side note on the dogbone... I had one that would "thunk" when accelerating and letting off. Turned out to be the dogbone was not bad but loose. The bracket on one (both???) side(s) is slightly slotted. If the bolt thru the dogbone is not tight it will slide back and forth under load.||||reg||1
