Z||000018||Bill Osmer||01-04-2000||10:57 AM||||fieroannie - Keep the faith!!<BR>After I got my 86 GT, I had to "catch up" on all the general maintenance the previous owner didn't do. Plus, on cars as old as ours (geriatric is a word I hear), a lot of items will normally begin to reach their life expectancy (unfortunately, it seems like they all go at once!). After I put an aditional $800 into mine ($600 for someone else to do brakes), it's now a fun, dependable daily driver. Plus, you get to meet the nicest people online when you ask questions!!! Now I've learned a lot about Fieros, and believe that they are dependable. (BTW, any other car of the same age will require the same effort/$$, but won't be as much fun).<P>Bill||||reg||1
